RUN INSTRUCTIONS:

To run you must add a .env file to the project in the root folder
The file should look something like this:

DB_HOST=host
DB_PORT=port
DB_NAME=databaseName
DB_TEST_NAME=databaseNameTest
DB_USER=user
DB_PASSWORD=yourPassword
SPRING_PROFILE=dev

In the frontend folder you should also add a .env file looking like:

VITE_API_URL=http://hostname

when running on web should run add a .env.properties file in the frontend folder as:

VITE_API_URL=website URL


PICKED  ADDITIONS:
I have added both padgination and searching to my project.

CONTRACT LOGIC:
A contract will have 5 feilds: id, employee, contractType, startDate and endDate.

Using the employee field the contract will be able to find all contracts an employee has.
The startDate and endDate fields can find which contract is active and ensure an employee has no overlapping contracts.
